  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "Row StateTabWin active0 and LeftMin-only distance, page extent/right distance clamped0 then uint16; SID_RULER_ROWS10992 and SID_RULER_ROWS_VERTICAL10993.",
    "Horizontal rows subtract Left; vertical writing mirrors each same-index separator and clamps negative limit differences0, without column-style reversal.",
    "Native invisible row tail uses Left horizontally or Right vertically, with Right as both constrained limits; original mutable model entries remain independent.",
    "Production horizontal-writing row view uses native vertical-ruler slot; real separator capture consumes item visibility/end/min/max, applies glMinFrame to internal maximum and previous-separator maximum at the bottom margin.",
    "Selected row preview writes the actual item end plus Left as in ExecuteTabWin, while following separators/table end move by the captured delta. Original SwTabCols retains model/apply, row/follow guards, original cursor/box/line owners and history; single-row margin is distinct from invisible item tail."
  ],
  "residuals": [
    "Full SvxRuler/SfxBindings/SfxItemSet slot ownership and complete StateTabWin page/frame/section contexts remain partial.",
    "Vertical/RTL document dragging, native row modifier/snapping/protection and single-row paragraph-indent bottom-margin range are not fully ported.",
    "Pooled item refcount guards/full uint16 WhichId and nonzero UNO members/default factory/presentation remain partial from iteration229.",
    "Registered IO/open/save/recovery/settings behavior remains byte-identical; no full upstream/module parity claim."
  ]
